      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她其实几乎不在学园里，总是跑去哪里旅行……\n学园方面也在考虑该拿她怎么办才好……——",
      "source_fingerprint": "21baac3784ce17de7245f30b100f24a11b7d25428a86f500e942b4ad334565f1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
