    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f7b8da96d55ad281031886fe",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……在那之后，我在训练员室里翻找过去的模拟赛记录，\n确认黄金旅程在学园里的跑姿。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0671249f200436c88283f7fa543c15c8f0e0203c02e36005984e8a7dc79a12ae",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
