      "uid": "zhcn:6586133c6955b0a4c4321f0d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "不知从何时起，看着那家伙奔跑的人们开始送上鼓励，\n说着『赢一次吧』、『今天一定可以』——",
      "source_fingerprint": "1d13896b77abedd266bf2cfddb41be517087dd6e62fad115689dd8b19215be09",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1135/storytimeline_041135002.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        4,
        "text"
