    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3d74926c88f511dc4b93d5ff",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在比赛结束后，黄金旅程一定会凝视着远方的某个地方。\n那个眼神……和那天对我讲述“蹄迹”时一模一样。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2c9ebb801d859be206dc7b00c98b9797a5b54e0741d1430058a525d1f2e293ab",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1135/storytimeline_041135002.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        43,
